# Shell functions the scanner sees no caller for, frozen 2026-09-15 when this
# repo turned the hub's --ratchets on. Two-way: a frozen function that gains a
# caller in this tree, or is deleted, goes STALE and fails the gate.
# Format: <file>	<function>.
# third_party/ANTfrastructure/docs/code-quality-tooling.md#dead-shell-functions-dead-functions

# The bootstrap template's API. scripts/linux/lib/antfrastructure.sh is a copy of
# the hub's shared/linux/templates/antfrastructure.sh (declared in
# .antfrastructure-shared.manifest, body-mode), and it publishes three entry
# points: antfrastructure_path, antfrastructure_source and antfrastructure_exec.
# This repo's five wrappers all delegate whole drivers, so they call _exec; _path
# is called from inside the file itself. _source is the one for consumers that
# pull in a LIBRARY rather than exec a driver -- it has callers in the family,
# just not in this tree, and deleting it here would drift the shared-config gate.
scripts/linux/lib/antfrastructure.sh	antfrastructure_source
